extends layouts/static

include svgs/icon
include svgs/hero
include svgs/cta
include svgs/fiverr
include svgs/github
include svgs/linkedin
include svgs/upwork
include components/footer

block hero-content 
  section.hero-content.container 
    article.hero-copy 
      section.left 
        h1 
          span.inherit Conversations without delay. 
          span.inherit Infrastructure without shortcuts.

        p Yapper is a production-ready messaging system featuring real-time transport, a professional Stripe-based paywall, and a high-performance architecture built for seamless communication and scalable cloud storage.

        .btn-group.reverse
          a.btn.primary(href="/chat") Get Started
          a.btn.outline(href="https://github.com/Zain-Khoso/Yapper", target="_blank") Source Code 
      
      +hero

    article#features.features-section 
      h3 Features 

      ul.features-list 
        li.feature-card 
          h4 Real-Time Transport
          span Sub-millisecond message delivery and live presence tracking powered by a robust Socket.io implementation.

        li.feature-card 
          h4 Stripe Paywall
          span A professional monetization engine with secure checkout and granular access to premium chat features.

        li.feature-card 
          h4 Edge Storage with R2
          span High-speed file transfers using Cloudflare R2 and presigned URLs to offload server traffic.

        li.feature-card 
          h4 Custom Vite Architecture
          span A high-performance hybrid setup merging server-side Pug templates with a modern Vite-driven build pipeline.

block content 
  main.page-contents
    section#testimonials.section.container 
      header.section-header 
        h4 Testimonials 
        h2 What do people think of Yapper?
      
      main.carousel
        button.control
          span.material-icons chevron_left

        ul.slides 
          li.slide 
            a(href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/muhammad-imtiaz-hussain/").person
              img.image(src="/assets/brand/testimonial-1.png", alt="MERN Stack Developer's Testimonial")
              
              div
                h4 Muhammad Imtiaz Hussain
                span.small MERN Stack Developer 
            
            span As a developer used to standard SPA setups, seeing Vite integrated directly as Express middleware was a game-changer. The way Yapper bridges SSR Pug templates with modern HMR and bundling feels like a sophisticated production-grade architecture rather than a simple project.

          li.slide 
            a(href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/thehassaanahmed/").person
              img.image(src="/assets/brand/testimonial-2.jpg", alt="Backend Engineer's Testimonial")
              
              div
                h4 Hassaan Ahmed
                span.small Backend Engineer
            
            span Socket.io is often easy to misuse, but Yapper handles real-time messaging and user presence cleanly. Combining that with Cloudflare R2 for presigned uploads shows a deep understanding of how to offload heavy traffic and build a system that can actually scale.

          li.slide 
            a(href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/adeen-khoso/").person
              img.image(src="/assets/user-placeholder.png", alt="React.js Developer's Testimonial")
              
              div
                h4 Muhammad Adeen
                span.small React.js Developer 
            
            span I was really impressed by the data layer. Most projects shy away from complex SQL, but Yapper handles Super Many-to-Many relations and database transactions with Sequelize flawlessly. It’s rare to find a project that balances complex business logic with clean, modular service files.

        button.control
          span.material-icons chevron_right

    section#pricing.section.container 
      header.section-header 
        h4 Pricing 
        h2 What other features does Yapper offer?
      
      ul.cards-list
        li.price-card 
          .header 
            h3 Silver
            
            h1 Free 
            
            span Perfect for trying Yapper.

          ul.perks-list 
            li.perk Account Registration
            li.perk 5 chatrooms
            li.perk 25 messages per chatroom
            li.perk 2 files per chatroom
            li.perk 5 calls per chatroom

          .btn-group
            a(href="/chat")#checkout-silver.btn.outline Get Started

        li.price-card 
          .header 
            h3 Gold
            
            h1 $5 
            
            span For more permanent usage.

          ul.perks-list 
            li.perk Everything in Silver
            li.perk Unlimited chatrooms
            li.perk Unlimited messages
            li.perk 50 files per chatroom
            li.perk Unlimited calls per chatroom

          .btn-group
            button#checkout-gold.btn.primary Become Golden

    section#creator.creator-section.container
      article.copy 
        .section-header 
          h4 Creator 
          h2 
            span.inherit Hi there, I'm 
            br
            span.inherit Zain Ul Abdin 
        
        p Zain is a web developer with 2 years of professional experience building applications for startups and clients worldwide. While working on real-time products, he repeatedly ran into the same problem—chat systems that were either over-engineered with heavy frameworks or too simplistic for production needs. That frustration led to Yapper: a high-performance messaging platform focused on architectural excellence. By merging the reliability of server-side rendering with the speed of modern build tools like Vite and esbuild, Zain created a system that prioritizes developer control, database integrity, and scalable cloud infrastructure.

        .actions
          .socials 
            a(href="https://linkedin.com/in/zain-khoso/", target="_blank") 
              +linkedin('icon', 'fill-foreground', 'stroke-foreground')

            a(href="https://github.com/Zain-Khoso", target="_blank") 
              +github('icon', 'fill-foreground', 'stroke-foreground')
            
            a(href="https://www.fiverr.com/zainkhosodev", target="_blank") 
              +fiverr('icon', 'fill-foreground', 'stroke-foreground')
            
            a(href="https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/~0149087552e102ee7e", target="_blank") 
              +upwork('icon', 'fill-foreground', 'fill-background', 'stroke-foreground')
            
          a.btn.primary(href="https://zain-khoso.vercel.app", target="_blank") Learn More

      img.picture(src="/assets/creator.png", alt="Picture of the creator")

    section.container
      article.cta 
        .copy 
          h2 Get started with Yapper today.

          span Spin up a professional messaging stack in minutes. Experience the power of a custom Vite-Express architecture, real-time transport, and Stripe-ready monetization—all in one high-performance package.

          .btn-group 
            a.btn.outline(href="https://github.com/Zain-Khoso/Yapper", target="_blank") View Docs 
            a.btn.primary(href="/signup") Start Free 

        +cta('illustration')

  +footer
